on></div></div><div class="rm-legend" data-testid="rm-legend"><span>to do · in progress · done · moved · blocked: each tile has an icon and a label</span><span>red dot = Risk high (stops for review)</span></div></section><section class="rm-section" data-testid="rm-milestones" aria-label="Milestones and phases"><h3 class="flow-h">Milestones and phases</h3><details class="rm-ms" id="ms-p-side-Phases"><summary><strong>Phases</strong> <span class="chip chip-waiting">in-progress</span></summary><ul class="flow-list"><li class="flow-row" data-testid="rm-phase" data-state="done"><div class="flow-row-head"><code class="mono">p-side#a1</code><button type="button" class="flow-title rm-open">A1</button><span class="rm-stage tile-done" data-testid="rm-stage">done</span></div><span class="flow-why">no model, lane or risk recorded · Tracker: ☑</span></li><li class="flow-row" data-testid="rm-phase" data-state="blocked"><div class="flow-row-head"><code class="mono">p-side#a2</code><button type="button" class="flow-title rm-open">A2</button><span class="rm-stage tile-blocked" data-testid="rm-stage">blocked</span></div><span class="flow-why">no model, lane or risk recorded · Tracker: ☐ blocked (ETL)</span></li><li class="flow-row" data-testid="rm-phase" data-state="todo"><div class="flow-row-head"><code class="mono">p-side#a3</code><button type="button" class="flow-title rm-open">A3</button><span class="rm-stage tile-todo" data-testid="rm-stage">to do</span></div><span class="flow-why">no model, lane or risk recorded · Tracker: ☐</span></li><li class="flow-row" data-testid="rm-phase" data-state="moved"><div class="flow-row-head"><code class="mono">p-side#a4</code><button type="button" class="flow-title rm-open">A4</button><span class="rm-stage tile-moved" data-testid="rm-stage">moved</span></div><span class="flow-why">no model, lane or risk recorded · Tracker: moved - to p-shop</span></li></ul></details></section></div></details></div></div>"`;
